  "published": "2026-11-24T14:13:13.547Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.4.1: SVG paint order fixes; overlapping filled dots keep document order and stroke=\"none\" shapes draw no outline. 0.4.0: Partial SVG/SVGZ import (shapes, paths, transforms, units, CSS subset, use/symbol, text, Inkscape layers) with additive DrawingFormat/SourceFormat, DrawingBackground/BackgroundMode, PlaceholderText, FillColor/FillDisc and LoadAsync(Stream, DrawingFormat) APIs; GPU-instanced filled discs and GPU-tessellated cubics; multisample antialiasing. Previously (0.3.0):Saved model-space VPORT and named VIEW cameras, perspective and depth clipping, and GPU depth display. Adds legacy 3D polylines/polyface meshes, MESH wireframes, straight/elliptical and explicit spline ACIS solid boundaries, tolerant topology, and complete untrimmed ring-torus surface display. All 13 Waschbecken sample solids load as boundary wireframes. Nonplan/perspective views are display-only; measurements remain projected XY. Requires Windows and .NET 10 Desktop Runtime. General trimmed surface shading, editing and DXF writing remain unsupported.",
